			>
		</a>
		<a href="https://codepen.io/joshsalazar" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
			<span class="sr-only">Josh Salazar on CodePen</span>
			<svg viewBox="0 0 512 512" aria-hidden="true" width="28" height="28" astro-icon="social/codepen"
				><path
					fill="currentColor"
					d="M502.285 159.703l-234-156a20.1 20.1 0 0 0-22.6 0l-234 156A19.99 19.99 0 0 0 2.685 176v160a19.999 19.999 0 0 0 8.9 16.6l234 157.4a20.11 20.11 0 0 0 22.4 0l234-157.4a19.999 19.999 0 0 0 8.9-16.6V176a19.99 19.99 0 0 0-8.6-16.297zM278.285 60.703l172.7 115.14-76.5 51.36-96.2-64.42zm-44 0v102.08l-96.2 64.42-76.5-51.36zm-192.6 151.997l55.2 37-55.2 37zm192.6 220.897l-172.7-115.14 76.5-51.36 96.2 64.42zm22-140.6l-96.9-65 96.9-65 96.9 65zm22 140.6v-102.08l96.2-64.42 76.5 51.36zm192.6-183.897l-55.2-37 55.2-37z"
